# UI: Tailwind + shadcn

New or changed UI uses **Tailwind utilities** and **shadcn primitives** in `src/components/ui`. Follow `design-system/MASTER.md` (page overrides in `design-system/pages/`).

## Do

```tsx
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';
import { Input } from '@/components/ui/input';
import { Label } from '@/components/ui/label';

<Label htmlFor="email">Email</Label>
<Input id="email" type="email" />
<Button type="submit" disabled={loading}>{loading ? 'Se trimite…' : 'Salvează'}</Button>
```

Missing primitive: `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` then import from `@/components/ui`.

Icons: Lucide (or official Google/Apple SVGs). Toasts: `Toaster` in root layout only.

## Don't

- New CSS modules / global classes that duplicate shadcn (`btn-primary`, etc.)
- Raw `<button>` / `<input>` when Button/Input exist
- Emoji as icons
- Placeholder-only fields (no `Label`)
- Async submit without `disabled` + loading text
